{"speciesId":427,"names":{"fr":"Laporeille","es":"Buneary","en":"Buneary","ja":"ミミロル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It slams foes by sharply uncoiling its rolled ears. It stings enough to make a grown-up cry in pain."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When it senses danger, it perks up its ears. On cold nights, it sleeps with its head tucked into its fur."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"You can tell how it feels by the way it rolls its ears. When it’s scared, both ears are rolled up."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"You can tell how it feels by the way it rolls its ears. When it’s scared, both ears are rolled up."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses oreilles repliées se déroulent avec une force capable de briser un gros rocher."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses oreilles repliées se déroulent avec une force capable de briser un gros rocher."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By extending its rolled-up ears and striking the ground, it can bound so high it surprises itself."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By extending its rolled-up ears and striking the ground, it can bound so high it surprises itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses oreilles repliées se déroulent avec une force capable de briser un gros rocher."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lleva las orejas enrolladas. Cuando las extiende, golpea con tal fuerza que incluso puede romper rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"いつも まるめている 耳を 勢いよく 伸ばすと 大きな 岩も 簡単に 壊せる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il dresse les oreilles quand il sent un danger. Il dort la tête dans sa fourrure pendant les nuits froides."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando siente peligro, levanta las orejas. En noches frías, duerme con la cabeza metida en el pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it senses danger, it perks up its ears. On cold nights, it sleeps with its head tucked into its fur."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"危険を 感じ取ると 両耳を 立てて 警戒する。寒い 夜は 毛皮に 顔を 埋めて 眠る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses oreilles repliées se déroulent avec une force capable de briser un gros rocher."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lleva las orejas enrolladas. Cuando las extiende, golpea con tal fuerza que incluso puede romper rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いつも まるめている 耳を 勢いよく 伸ばすと 大きな 岩も 簡単に 壊せる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il dresse les oreilles quand il sent un danger. Il dort la tête dans sa fourrure pendant les nuits froides."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando siente peligro, levanta las orejas. En noches frías, duerme con la cabeza metida en el pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When it senses danger, it perks up its ears. On cold nights, it sleeps with its head tucked into its fur."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"危険を 感じ取ると 両耳を 立てて 警戒する。寒い 夜は 毛皮に 顔を 埋めて 眠る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il possède peu de force dans ses membres, mais il lui suffit de déplier son oreille comme un ressort pour réduire un rocher en poussière."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si bien sus extremidades pecan de débiles, si enrolla las orejas y luego las extiende, puede hacer añicos incluso rocas bien grandes."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its arms and legs are weak, but when it rolls its ears up tight and then unleashes them with its full force, it can smash boulders to dust."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"手足の力は 弱いが ぎゅっと 丸めた耳を おもいきり のばすと 大きな岩も 粉々に 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"S’il a toujours une oreille repliée, c’est pour être à même de contre-attaquer dès qu’un ennemi tente de s’en prendre à lui."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Siempre tiene una de las orejas enrollada para poder contraatacar de inmediato si un enemigo lanza su ofensiva."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The reason it keeps one ear rolled up is so it can launch a swift counterattack if it’s attacked by an enemy."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"片方の 耳を いつも 丸めて いるのは 敵に 襲われた とき すぐに 反撃する ためだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand ses deux oreilles sont repliées, c’est signe qu’il ne se sent pas bien physiquement ou mentalement et qu’il a besoin de soins."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando enrolla ambas orejas, es señal de que tiene algún tipo de malestar físico o emocional y necesita cuidados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If both of Buneary’s ears are rolled up, something is wrong with its body or mind. It’s a sure sign the Pokémon is in need of care."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"左右の 耳を 丸めているときは 体や 心の 不調が 原因なので ケアが 必要。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Plus il s’entraîne, plus les coups qu’il assène en déroulant vigoureusement ses oreilles gagnent en puissance."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Ataca estirando con un fuerte impulso las orejas enrolladas. Cuanto más entrena esta técnica, con más potencia la ejecuta."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Buneary can attack by rolling up their ears and then striking with the force created by unrolling them. This attack becomes stronger with training."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"まるめた 耳を 伸ばす 勢いで 攻撃する 技は トレーニングを するほど 威力が 増していく。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"My hypothesis as to why Buneary rolls up its ears is that its hearing is far too keen. I surmise that the Pokémon protects its hearing by limiting the sound that may enter its ears."}],"varieties":[{"id":427,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[20,"level-up",20],[23,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"jump-kick","learns":[[8,"level-up",23],[9,"level-up",23],[10,"level-up",23],[11,"level-up",23],[14,"level-up",23],[15,"level-up",23],[16,"level-up",23],[17,"level-up",23],[18,"level-up",23]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up"